rds. \nUse <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</> in the Spirit Illusion Altar Shop to redeem rewards. When obtaining a Spirit Illusion tier appearance reward that exceeds the possession limit, it will be decomposed into a specific number of <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</>. \nAfter checking to use <Highlight>Holy Grails</> to offset <Highlight>Bound Holy Grails</> for summoning, the rewards obtained using Holy Grails for summoning will <Highlight>not be tradable or giftable</> and will be counted towards the Bound Holy Grail pity progress. \n\n<Highlight>[Probability Disclosure]</>\nDivine Blessed reward probability (including pity): 0.873%\n<Highlight>Divine Blessed Card</>: 0.793%\n<Highlight>Pale Crown</>: 0.080%\n\nSpirit Illusion reward probability (including pity): 10.928%\nStar-Reflected Green Night Top, Star-Reflected Green Night Bottom, Star-Reflected Green Night Accessory, Star-Reflected Green Night Ornament, Ode Dress Hairstyle, Ode Dress Top, Ode Dress Bottom, Ode Dress Accessory, Flower Half-Face, Ghost Ship Helm, Time Clock, Spirit Illusion Card*10, Spirit Illusion Card*5\n\nBeyonder reward probability (including pity): 88.199%\nSpirit Illusion Card, Aggregation Factor, Foam Dye, Coral Dye, Pop Fireworks, Ribbon Fireworks, Party Fireworks, Strange Potion, Simple Torch, Pure Love Lute, Elephant Doll, Cold Wrapping Cloth, Glorious Inheritance, Curly-Haired Baboon Hair, Lucky Big Wheel, Shell Necklace, Pearl Brooch",
